config BR2_PACKAGE_Q2_IROH
	bool "q2-iroh"
	help
	  Car Remote across networks (docs/carrd.md, docs/remote.md#car-remote-across-networks):
	  q2-iroh, the iroh sidecar q2carrd runs while Wi-Fi has a link. Rust, so not built
	  here: tools/iroh.py's pinned binary from the third-party cache, checked by its
	  SHA-256 (docs/vamp-os-base.md#toolchain-decisions).
